{"data": [{"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-29T01:10:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115612224215814267"], "id": "2115612224215814267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 275, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "高盛 A 股收盘\n\n上证指数 +0.91%|科创 50 +2.45%\n上证 50 +0.23%|创业板指 +3.40%\n沪深 300 +0.85%|中证 500 +1.99%\n全天总成交额 1.64 万亿元,较前一日上涨 11.49%\nA 股跟随亚太市场强势走势迎来修复反弹。\n上证指数下午盘中震荡加大,但是在 AI 供应链久违反弹的支撑之下,收盘收在高位。", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2115612224215814267"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-28T15:18:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115463235541573857"], "id": "2115463235541573857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 575, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📑 高盛 A 股收盘\n\n📊 上证指数 +0.91%｜科创 50 +2.45%\n📊 上证 50 +0.23%｜创业板指 +3.40%\n📊 沪深 300 +0.85%｜中证 500 +1.99%\n💴 全天总成交额 1.64 万亿元，较前一日上涨 11.49%\n📈 A 股跟随亚太市场强势走势迎来修复反弹。\n📌 上证指数下午盘中震荡加大，但是在 AI", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2115463235541573857"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:17:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115765049008808418"], "id": "2115765049008808418", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 529, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "交易台 - 高盛中国收评\n\n上证综指 - 0.82%、科创 50 -4.27%；\n上证 50 +0.36%、创业板指 -4.45%；\n沪深 300 -1.03%、中证 500 -2.82%。\n全市场总成交额 1.57 万亿元，环比下降 4.35%。\n\n国内 AI 板块波动延续，创业板指、科创 50 在前一日短暂反弹之后，今日双双跌超 4%。Alphabet", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2115765049008808418"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:59:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115775630805778822"], "id": "2115775630805778822", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 819, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "交易台 - 高盛中国收评\n\n上证综指 - 0.82%、科创 50 -4.27%;\n上证 50 +0.36%、创业板指 -4.45%;\n沪深 300 -1.03%、中证 500 -2.82%。\n全市场总成交额 1.57 万亿元,环比下降 4.35%。\n\n国内 AI 板块波动延续,创业板指、科创 50 在前一日短暂反弹之后,今日双双跌超 4%。Alphabet", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2115775630805778822"}, {"author_id": "1305374184", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:16:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115779851391324209"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Dy1BwVdfUZ", "end": 55, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/s_hxxtn/status/2115779851391324209/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115779302415589376", "start": 32, "url": "https://t.co/Dy1BwVdfUZ"}]}, "id": "2115779851391324209", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 551, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "五中全会A股继续跌 创业板指下挫4.45% 4728个股飘绿! https://t.co/Dy1BwVdfUZ", "url": "https://x.com/s_hxxtn/status/2115779851391324209"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-29T10:30:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115753058374406564"], "id": "2115753058374406564", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 668, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "交易台 - 高盛中国午盘\n\n上证综指-0.93% 科创50 -4.21%\n上证50-0.21% 创业板指-3.63%\n沪深300-1.18% 中证500-2.60%\n中国 A 股总成交额(万亿人民币):1.00\n\n继昨日反弹后,中国 A", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2115753058374406564"}, {"author_id": "1895260957330518016", "created_at": "2026-10-29T01:53:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115622901730664458"], "id": "2115622901730664458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 426, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "天塌啦，昨天 A 股这波反弹，是放量真金白银砸出来的。\n\n10 月 28 日，A 股市场放量反弹，主要指数全线上涨，截至收盘，上证指数、深证成指、创业板指、科创综指、北证 50 指数分别上涨 0.91%、2.02%、3.40%、3.20%、1.63%，大小盘股携手反弹，大盘股集中的上证 50 指数、沪深 300 指数分别上涨", "url": "https://x.com/lg8306/status/2115622901730664458"}, {"author_id": "1380720896038424579", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115803338365415425"], "id": "2115803338365415425", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 482, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10月29日A股复盘：\n\n资金面：大资金流出888亿、超大单流出323亿，散户接766亿；北向流出525亿，量化跟随流出。两融流出582亿、半导体流出371亿，是最大抛压方向。\n\n超大单买入前五：军工、必选消费、风电、农业、医疗，合计不到20亿——量级小，是防御性调仓，不是进攻。", "url": "https://x.com/suyu2018block/status/2115803338365415425"}, {"author_id": "1634530036152963072", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:23:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115419098066845739", "2115419612838051994"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qLvMRfwSgq", "end": 192, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/maobidao/status/2115419098066845739/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115418739592286208", "start": 169, "url": "https://t.co/qLvMRfwSgq"}]}, "id": "2115419098066845739", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "明天要开盘了，把重要的事情简单捋一下。\n今天上证收在 3681.47，涨 0.91%，早盘低开 0.78%，全天振幅只有 0.88%，收盘站在全天 91% 的位置上，这个形态叫一路往上顶，低开那点口子当天就补掉还多给了一截。\n真正有故事的在下面那张脸。深成指涨 2.02%，创业板指涨 3.40%，科创50 涨 2.45%，中证1000 https://t.co/qLvMRfwSgq", "url": "https://x.com/maobidao/status/2115419098066845739"}, {"author_id": "1609897027709861888", "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:55:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115699033620746451"], "id": "2115699033620746451", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1058, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "盘面速览\n\n**指数全线走弱，风格极致分化。**", "url": "https://x.com/SYU77996/status/2115699033620746451"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-28T02:48:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115274487931469996"], "id": "2115274487931469996", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 643, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "开盘高开1%直接冲顶，然后一路往下磨——沪指从3677砸回3654，涨幅只剩+0.16%，机器人+传媒在里面硬撑\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2115274487931469996"}, {"author_id": "782441079366746113", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:28:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115813022090608897"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 3, "start": 0, "tag": "A股"}]}, "id": "2115813022090608897", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股 10月29日资金复盘。今天的数据透着极致的撕裂感，大资金疯狂出逃，散户高位接盘，但另一头ETF却在拼命吸筹。直接看底牌：\n \n一、 资金面：主力狂砸，散户接盘", "url": "https://x.com/CPYS88/status/2115813022090608897"}, {"author_id": "1219037676474527745", "created_at": "2026-10-28T09:04:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115368981150433514"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 154, "start": 151, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 159, "start": 155, "tag": "半导体"}]}, "id": "2115368981150433514", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 104, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中韩半导体ETF一天成交202亿，居全市场第一\n\n全市场成交额第一的ETF，是投资韩国芯片的。\n\n不是沪深300，不是创业板，是中韩半导体，当天涨8.05%。\n\n同一天，酒ETF跌1.93%，券商ETF跌1.55%。\n\n资金不是在加仓A股，是在从防守里搬家到存储。\n\n你觉得这是新主线，还是一日游？\n\n#A股 #半导体", "url": "https://x.com/WindRider_Stock/status/2115368981150433514"}, {"author_id": "1708855658068742144", "created_at": "2026-10-29T08:09:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115717610948198704"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 3, "start": 0, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 15, "start": 4, "tag": "A股缩量720亿调整"}, {"end": 21, "start": 16, "tag": "收盘复盘"}]}, "id": "2115717610948198704", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 713, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股 #A股缩量720亿调整 #收盘复盘 \n\n10-29收评：美联储鹰派叠加AI业绩暴雷，创业板大跌4.45%，明日如何演绎？\n \n周四盘面复盘：美联储释放鹰派信号，海外AI巨头财报不及预期，多重利空冲击A股，科技板块集体走弱，3600点关口迎来严峻考验。", "url": "https://x.com/Khoibin00/status/2115717610948198704"}, {"author_id": "304165652", "created_at": "2026-10-28T07:41:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115348174097498331"], "id": "2115348174097498331", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 333, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "股价拖累，三季度基金持有券商股市值缩水133亿，被动资金是加仓主力\n\n财联社10月28日讯（记者 陈俊兰）随着公募基金三季报披露收官，基金对券商股的配置变化浮出水面。", "url": "https://x.com/najoygo/status/2115348174097498331"}, {"author_id": "1006082493659746304", "created_at": "2026-10-28T08:43:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115363931871121867"], "id": "2115363931871121867", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "创业板午盘涨 3%，人形机器人 30 只股涨停——导火索是上海昨天印发的智能制造行动方案。\n\n沪指午盘 +0.72% 报 3674，深成指 +1.99%，半天成交 1.01 万亿。政策托底还在，机器人是今天最硬的题材。\n\n但先别喊反转：量没回 2", "url": "https://x.com/tuscan_moon/status/2115363931871121867"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:41:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115333207734550708"], "id": "2115333207734550708", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 661, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 午后跟踪 | 沪指+0.83%摸到3684.49就是差那半口气，创指冲高3.90%又全吐回来了\n\n▪️ 午后指数变动：上午高开冲高，下午原地磨\n沪指午间3674.44（+0.72%）→ 现在3678.70（+0.83%），两个多小时只挪了4个点。全天最高3684.49，是早上打出来的，离昨天箱体下沿3685就差0.51点，愣是没敢碰。", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2115333207734550708"}, {"author_id": "720195544044273664", "created_at": "2026-10-28T07:10:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115340471321194774"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 3, "start": 0, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 9, "start": 4, "tag": "收盘复盘"}, {"end": 14, "start": 11, "tag": "收评"}]}, "id": "2115340471321194774", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股 #收盘复盘  #收评 \n\n收盘点评：创业板反弹超 3%，放量反弹仍需二次确认\n\n今日 A 股震荡修复，成长赛道领涨。创业板指大涨超 3%，深成指、科创 50 涨幅均超 2%。两市全天成交 1.63 万亿，较前一日放量 1675 亿，全市场超 4100 只个股收涨，普涨格局下市场赚钱效应明显回暖。", "url": "https://x.com/moo840805/status/2115340471321194774"}, {"author_id": "1380720896038424579", "created_at": "2026-10-28T11:40:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115408235427426647"], "id": "2115408235427426647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 396, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10月28日的A股复盘：\n\n资金流向：大资金净流入211亿，超大资金流入303亿，散户流出202亿，北向资金放量至250亿、净流入400亿，连续4天爆量。\n\n买入方向：融资融券（杠杆加仓大市值）、半导体芯片、5G/6G偏C端、机器人、数据中心和算力。", "url": "https://x.com/suyu2018block/status/2115408235427426647"}, {"author_id": "1810525451485614080", "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:37:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115332094616342742"], "id": "2115332094616342742", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天A股小微盘股突然暴力反弹，中证2000半天涨了2.76%，中证1000涨了2.6%，而上证50几乎趴着没动。很多人以为是中小盘基本面反转了，其实说白了就是跌透了之后的超跌修复。", "url": "https://x.com/haige2330/status/2115332094616342742"}, {"author_id": "1119515384019709952", "created_at": "2026-10-29T03:05:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115641224447328747"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/FRzM8gA5x7", "end": 208, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jtx_ai/status/2115641224447328747/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115640769679958016", "start": 185, "url": "https://t.co/FRzM8gA5x7"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/FRzM8gA5x7", "end": 208, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jtx_ai/status/2115641224447328747/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115640930422452224", "start": 185, "url": "https://t.co/FRzM8gA5x7"}]}, "id": "2115641224447328747", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "国家队花了 1584 亿，但 90% 的人猜错了它买了什么。\n\n1,584 亿进场，九成砸在了最“旧”的那一半；而 沪深300 的单日买盘，正从 312 亿断崖式缩到 76 亿。\n10/14 到 10/27，我把所有主流宽基 ETF 的份额变动扒了一遍：\n• 四只沪深300ETF：净申购 1,253 亿\n• 上证50ETF：157 亿\n• 中证500ETF：97 亿 https://t.co/FRzM8gA5x7", "url": "https://x.com/jtx_ai/status/2115641224447328747"}, {"author_id": "1596664795532390401", "created_at": "2026-10-28T14:41:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115453815134806493"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lKAQzJVwlA", "end": 150, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AkZfl/status/2115453815134806493/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115453806482001920", "start": 127, "url": "https://t.co/lKAQzJVwlA"}]}, "id": "2115453815134806493", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 287, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国的AI泡沫，已经破了。你还在盯着英伟达的时候，它就破了。\n\n科创50，A股AI和芯片的门面，6月30日收盘2208点，昨天最低收到1252点，不到4个月跌了四成多，蒸发大约4800亿美元。沪深300从6月高点跌了约20%，上证昨天收在14个月新低。 https://t.co/lKAQzJVwlA", "url": "https://x.com/AkZfl/status/2115453815134806493"}, {"author_id": "2060298489305890816", "created_at": "2026-10-28T04:48:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115304634638291293"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/mMpFH0rIgg", "end": 130, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2115304634638291293/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115304620121870336", "start": 107, "url": "https://t.co/mMpFH0rIgg"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/mMpFH0rIgg", "end": 130, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2115304634638291293/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115304620184727552", "start": 107, "url": "https://t.co/mMpFH0rIgg"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/mMpFH0rIgg", "end": 130, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2115304634638291293/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115304620126089217", "start": 107, "url": "https://t.co/mMpFH0rIgg"}]}, "id": "2115304634638291293", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天午盘这波反弹，更接近一次“超跌修复+情绪催化”的脉冲，而非趋势性反转的确立。它有真实的催化剂，但资金面和技术面尚未给出持续性的确认信号。\n\n📈 反弹的驱动：有“真东西”，但偏外部和情绪\n\n今天领涨的核心逻辑是 https://t.co/mMpFH0rIgg", "url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/s